WEBVTT

00:00:16.120 --> 00:00:17.080
Annie?

00:00:18.360 --> 00:00:19.600
Rachel!

00:00:19.720 --> 00:00:21.320
Long time no see! How are you?

00:00:21.440 --> 00:00:22.600
I'm great.

00:00:22.720 --> 00:00:24.480
What a lovely surprise!

00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:25.400
Great to see you!

00:00:25.520 --> 00:00:26.480
Yeah! You too.

00:00:26.600 --> 00:00:28.600
When did we last see each other?

00:00:28.720 --> 00:00:30.760
Oh, I think it was about...

00:00:30.880 --> 00:00:32.120
six years ago!

00:00:32.760 --> 00:00:34.440
So ... where are you living these days?

00:00:34.560 --> 00:00:35.840
Oh, not far from here...

00:00:35.960 --> 00:00:37.520
I live on Hampton Street...

00:00:37.640 --> 00:00:38.680
Do you know it?

00:00:38.800 --> 00:00:41.200
Yes, I do. That's really close to the centre.

00:00:41.320 --> 00:00:42.480
Mmm. How about you?

00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:44.040
We live on Compton Road.

00:00:44.160 --> 00:00:45.880
Oh - how nice!

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:47.240
My name's Mark, by the way.

00:00:47.400 --> 00:00:48.480
Hi. Nice to meet you.

00:00:48.600 --> 00:00:49.960
Nice to meet you, too.

00:00:50.080 --> 00:00:52.280
Sorry, yes - Mark's my husband!

00:00:52.400 --> 00:00:54.160
Husband - wow!

00:00:54.280 --> 00:00:55.680
That's fantastic news.

00:00:55.840 --> 00:00:57.240
When did you get married?

00:00:57.400 --> 00:00:58.520
-Six months ago.
-Eight months ago.

00:01:00.040 --> 00:01:02.040
It was six, Mark.

00:01:03.320 --> 00:01:05.520
Well, congratulations!

00:01:05.640 --> 00:01:08.000
I want to know all the details!

00:01:08.520 --> 00:01:10.840
Look - I'm going to the café down the street now...

00:01:10.960 --> 00:01:12.760
...to meet Leo, my boyfriend.

00:01:13.160 --> 00:01:14.920
Would you both like to come?

00:01:16.520 --> 00:01:17.960
Yeah, that sounds good.

00:01:18.080 --> 00:01:19.000
Brilliant!

00:01:19.120 --> 00:01:20.240
Let's go.
